{"id": "141849", "name": "בחירת תת-קבוצה אורתונורמלית", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "innerproduct", "params": ["x", "y"], "body": "block([listarith],listarith:true,ratsimp(conjugate(x).y))"}, {"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "randvervectnonzero", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[0]),n))"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "inSpan", "params": ["veclst1", "veclst2"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst1)) = rank(matrify(append(veclst1,veclst2))))"}, {"name": "dezero", "params": ["vec", "n", "k"], "body": "if (zeromatrixp(vec)) then randvervectnonzero(n,k) else vec"}, {"name": "mysimp", "params": ["x"], "body": "rootscontract(simplify(rootscontract(simplify(rootscontract(x)))))"}, {"name": "prod", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "mysimp(expand(transpose(u).v))"}, {"name": "perpp", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "is(prod(u,v)=0)"}, {"name": "unitvectp", "params": ["u"], "body": "is(prod(u,u)=1)"}, {"name": "unitvectify", "params": ["u"], "body": "block([norm: sqrt(prod(u,u))], if (norm=0) then u else (u/norm))"}, {"name": "maybescale", "params": ["v"], "body": "if (rand(2)=0) then rand([1/3,1/2,1,2,3])*v else v"}, {"name": "alltrue", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "emptyp(delete(true,map(pred, lst)))"}, {"name": "leavefalses", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "sublist(lst,lambda([ex],not pred(ex)))"}, {"name": "pairs", "params": ["n"], "body": "block(lst: [],for i:1 thru (n-1) do(for j:i+1 thru n do(lst: endcons([i,j],lst))), lst)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים שישה וקטורים מהמרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^3\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(v_1={{CT:0}}\\),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(v_2={{CT:1}}\\),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(v_3={{CT:2}}\\),</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(v_4={{CT:3}}\\),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(v_5={{CT:4}}\\),&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(v_6={{CT:5}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>בחרו תת-קבוצה של הוקטורים המהווה בסיס אורתונורמלי למרחב.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">הזינו את תשובתכם כרשימת אינדקסים <strong>ללא חזרות</strong>.<br>למשל, אם אתם סבורים ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{v_1,v_2,v_3\\}\\)</span> בסיס אורתונורמלי למרחב, הזינו <code dir=\"ltr\">[1,2,3]</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "validInput: alltrue(lambda([ex],is(integerp(ex) and ex>0 and ex <=6 and length(unique(ans1)) = length(ans1))),ans1);\nans: if (validInput) then ans1 else [];\n\nnottooshort: is(length(ans) >2);\nnottoolong: is(length(ans) <4);\n\nvecans: map(lambda([i],vecs[i]),ans);\n\nnonunits: leavefalses(unitvectp,vecans);\n\nperpidxs(idxs):= perpp(vecans[idxs[1]],vecans[idxs[2]]);\nnonperp: leavefalses(perpidxs, pairs(length(vecans)));\nnonperpex: if (nonperp=[]) then 0 else first(nonperp);\n\nindependent: not dependentvects(vecans);\n\nperfect: is(validInput and nottoolong and nottooshort and independent and nonunits=[] and nonperp=[]);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "validInput", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הרשימה שהזנת אינה תקינה. נתבקשת להזין רשימה של מספרים בין 1 ל-6 ללא חזרות</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nottooshort", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הרשימה שהזנת קצרה מדי. בסיס למרחב ממימד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> מונה בדיוק <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> וקטורים.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nottoolong", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הרשימה שהזנת ארוכה מדי. בסיס למרחב ממימד <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> מונה בדיוק <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\)</span> וקטורים.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nonunits", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">חלק מהוקטורים שבחרת אינם מייצגים וקטורים מנורמה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1\\)</span>: {@nonunits@}</div>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nonperp", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 5, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">חלק מהוקטורים שבחרת אינם מאונכים זה לזה. למשל עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v={@vecans[nonperpex[1]]@}\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={@vecans[nonperpex[2]]@}\\)</span> מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((v,u) = {@expand(prod(vecans[nonperpex[1]],vecans[nonperpex[2]]))@}\\)</span></div>"}}, {"name": 5, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "independent", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 6, "answernote": "prt1-6-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-6-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">הוקטורים שבחרת תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 6, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "perfect", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-7-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך נכונה.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-7-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך אינה נכונה.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["B", "Bidx", "Extidx", "coefs", "extravecs", "k", "n", "perm", "possibleans", "randloc", "v1", "v2", "v3", "vecs"], "nvariants": 50}